%% Part 2 of a turn: inside agent_loop (PII full, tool-output guard on, prompt guard on)
sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant L as agent_loop
  participant G as Guards<br/>(prompt guard, PII input)
  participant M as Masking<br/>(+ vault)
  participant LLM as LLM
  participant O as Tool orchestrator
  participant TO as Tool-output check

  L->>G: prompt guard on the new user message
  L->>G: PII input check on every user message
  Note right of G: scan cache: only messages<br/>after the last checkpoint
  L->>M: new per-turn vault

  loop each LLM call
    L->>M: mask the request (user, tool, assistant)
    Note right of M: scan cache: only new messages<br/>PII → [SENS:PII:…] placeholders
    L->>LLM: masked request
    LLM-->>L: tool call or final answer
    opt tool call
      L->>O: run the tool call
      O->>O: tool_input chain (sees placeholders)
      opt tool listed in pii.demask_tool_args
        O->>M: demask the listed args
      end
      O->>O: execute the tool
      O->>TO: check the RAW tool output
      TO-->>O: pass, or replace the result
      O-->>L: tool result
    end
  end

  L->>M: mask PII in the model's answer (output layer, one-way)
  L->>M: demask the answer from the vault
  L->>L: output chain on the final answer
